    native_build_hir_cache_0_disables_positional_route_sharding_2026-11-09, 0, "2026-11-27 w4-3: selected fail-closed option because driver_hir_pipeline_lowering requires hir_cache_enabled() for hir_shard_active() and existing refusal specs enforce refusing SIMPLE_HIR_CACHE=0; added pure helpers native_build_hir_disabled_reason_v1 and native_build_pool_refusal_message_v1 in src/app/cli/native_build_main.spl explaining why the positional/per-file route requires HIR cache and directing callers to unset SIMPLE_HIR_CACHE=0 or use SIMPLE_FILE_WORKERS=0 --entry-closure or SIMPLE_BOOTSTRAP_WHOLE_PROGRAM=1; native_build_hir_cache_0_refusal_spec 4/4, native_build_pool_refusal_spec 20/20, native_file_worker_v1_spec 16/16, p3_shard_admission_diag_spec 4/4 all PASS; waiting-for: end-to-end native-build CLI invocation under SIMPLE_HIR_CACHE=0 verification."

